(  261) !$acc & PWUBASE, KLAB, LDCUM, LDSC, KCBOT, KBOTSC, KCTOP, KDPL, PCAPE, YDTHF, YDCST, YDEPHLI, YDECLDP, YDECUMF, YDSPP_CONFIG
